# SLICE-02 asset authoring (run once; its outputs are committed): the wall's mesh and its 2-level fracture.
# Modeling > Shapes Box 300 x 200 x 25 cm (centre pivot) -> its .stmesh; Fracture mode, two Uniform levels (the
# panel's default level + Add Level), Generate from the selected mesh -> Fractures/Fracture.dfrac, then moved by
# hand to Meshes/Modeling/Wall.stmesh and Fractures/Wall.dfrac (the GUIDs in their headers keep every reference).
Дано run Scene "Open Scene Starter.desce"
Дано run View "View mode: Lit"
Дано run Panel "Open Modeling"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape tool: Box"
Дано run Modeling "Create shape pivot: Centre"
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Width 300
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Height 200
Дано --subject modeling set CreateShape.Box.Depth 40
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Position -450,400,-100
Дано --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.8,0.6
Дано run Modeling "Create shape: place at the viewport centre"
Дано --subject selection set Translation -450,100,250
Дано run Modeling "Active tool: Accept"
Когда run Fracture "Fracture mode"
Когда run Fracture "Add Level"
Когда run Fracture "Random Seed: next"
Когда run Fracture "Generate from the selected static mesh"
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Position -450,150,-150
Когда --subject viewport set Camera.Direction 0,-0.1,1
Тогда-вид 0_baked the 300 x 200 cm wall with its fracture's pieces outlined
